<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team.</p>

<p>I was sorry to hear that you were disappointed with the team member you dealt with on <em><strong>&lt;insert date&gt; .</strong></em><br />
<br />
Our team go through comprehensive training to provide the highest standards of service, and I apologise that we didn't deliver to this service standard on this occasion.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed your comments on to the relevant team so we can work on improving this aspect of our service in future.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
